- [ ] **12. Floor-to-ceiling glass wall with thin dark posts**: glass_pane y=2..4 between dark_oak_log posts on every beam line x=10..31; only base (y=1) and header (y=5) stay opaque. Part 4. Vocab `glass_bay`, `post`.
